<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 24-JUN					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 24-JUN					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Peter, with 40 mph winds, is in the Philippine Sea near 14.5n/127.2e, moving west at 5 mph. It is expected to slowly gain strength, turn to the northwest, and pick up speed during the next 24-36 hours, passing northeast of the northern Philippines. This system will be a threat mostly to shipping.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
